# S62-2: e1m1's start, the scaled 2-D layer off too. A still camera, the status bar and
# the gun. S62-0 is the slop preset; each next render switches one more option off (1
# Hor+, 2 the scaled 2-D layer, 3 the status bar overlay, 4 the perspective span back to
# 16, 5 smooth monsters, 6 gliding lights, 7 the torch flicker); S62-8 is the Classic
# preset (960x600 in its 4:3 box, id's 72 Hz ticks).
#
# Under V3-53: "Every change has a name. Every name can be switched off."
#
# Assembly (S62, the film's S62.clean): S62-0 until file second 1.4; from then, every 0.4
# s, a 0.2 s dissolve (smoothstep) to the next render, ending on S62-8 at 4.2. The options
# ladder over it is the edit's; a version with its own column of struck-through option
# names was not used.

map e1m1

duration 6.8
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset slop
hud on
gun on
cvar gamma 0.8
cvar fov_adapt 0
cvar wasm_scaled2d 0

camera fixed 480,-352,110 0,90

sound off
events on
